#~ msgid ""
#~ "The mark 4 Adder is a rare sight these days due to the success its "
#~ "successor, the mark 5 Adder, which often replaces this model. Its similar "
#~ "hull, however, means careless buyers are sometimes conned into buying "
#~ "mark 4 models disguised as the mark 5."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Le Vipère MK4 se fait rare de nos jours en raison du succès de son "
#~ "successeur, le Vipère MK5, qui le remplace désormais. Leur coque étant "
#~ "similaire, certains acheteurs imprudents achètent parfois des modèles MK4 "
